    (0, None, '\'Vitya, why did you lie to Tanya about me?\' "Obmanul" is "deceived", "lied to", as in Kostya\'s "ya nikogda tebya ne obmanyvayu". "Pro menya" is a casual "about me". "Vitya" is the short, friendly form of Viktor.'),
